    <briefdescription>
<para>Postcondition failure error. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><ref refid="classcslt_1_1PostconditionFailError" kindref="compound">PostconditionFailError</ref> represents an error when a postcondition or invariant is violated after an operation.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="par"><title>Example Usage:</title><para><programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal">throw<sp/>PostconditionFailError();<sp/><sp/>//<sp/>&quot;Postcondition<sp/>failed&quot;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">throw<sp/>PostconditionFailError(&quot;Invariant<sp/>violated:<sp/>size<sp/>must<sp/>equal<sp/>capacity&quot;);</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting> </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
